#lang treason

;; Slides: "Where Do the Services Come From?"
;;
;; The walkthrough program. When expansion reaches the reference to x on the
;; second line, x and y are in scope and x resolves to the definition above.
;; The expander records that, and go-to-definition and autocomplete read it
;; back. This program has no errors, so it also runs. The final y is not on
;; the slide; it's here so running the program prints something.

(define x 1)
(define y (+ x 2))
y
